{ (Writing short children's stories, mostly about printers, one US Letter sheet at a time, on a printer you own or have permission to use. Demonstrating that a print job is a program.) fseg 9 fTI (Out of scope: prompts. The model chooses the plot.) fseg } cpara
/curY curY 9 sub def
