{ (It will hallucinate a quiet salad.) fseg } citem
{ (No prompt input: every story starts from the beginning-of-sequence token.) fseg } citem
{ (Needs a PostScript interpreter, Level 2 or later. PCL- or GDI-only printers may print the file as text.) fseg } citem
{ (Long jobs may hit the printer's job timeout or run out of VM.) fseg } citem
